#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:61
msgid "Asyncmark Operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:63
msgid ""
"An *asyncmark* in the abstract machine tracks all the async operations that "
"are *program-ordered* before that asyncmark. An asyncmark M is said to be "
"*completed* only when all async operations *program-ordered* before M are "
"reported by the implementation as having finished, and it is said to be "
"*outstanding* otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:68
msgid "Thus we have the following sufficient condition:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:70
msgid ""
"An async operation X is *completed* at a program point P if there exists an "
"asyncmark M such that X is *program-ordered* before M, M is *program-"
"ordered* before P, and M is completed. X is said to be *outstanding* at P "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:74
msgid ""
"The abstract machine maintains a sequence of asyncmarks during the execution "
"of a function body, which excludes any asyncmarks produced by calls to other "
"functions encountered in the currently executing function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:79
msgid "``@llvm.amdgcn.asyncmark()``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:81
msgid ""
"When executed, inserts an asyncmark in the sequence associated with the "
"currently executing function body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:85
msgid "``@llvm.amdgcn.wait.asyncmark(i16 %N)``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:87
msgid ""
"Waits until there are at most N outstanding asyncmarks in the sequence "
"associated with the currently executing function body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:91
msgid "Memory Consistency Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:93
msgid ""
"Each asynchronous operation consists of a non-atomic read on the source and "
"a non-atomic write on the destination. Async \"LDS DMA\" intrinsics result "
"in async accesses that guarantee visibility relative to other memory "
"operations as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:98
msgid ""
"An asynchronous operation `A` program ordered before an overlapping memory "
"operation `X` happens-before `X` only if `A` is completed before `X`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:101
msgid ""
"A memory operation `X` program ordered before an overlapping asynchronous "
"operation `A` happens-before `A`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:106
msgid ""
"The *only if* in the above wording implies that unlike the default LLVM "
"memory model, certain program order edges are not automatically included in "
"``happens-before``."
msgstr ""

